juries, so 70 games instead of Yahoo's 73.","sources":["https://youtu.be/lOshTzDA4SA?t=505","https://youtu.be/uarqbNA2dFk?t=1100"]},{"field":"usg","text":"He had 30 usage at Kansas and 38 in Summer League, but here he shares the ball with three high-usage players, so about 24.","sources":["https://youtu.be/RyzcCGChYgs?t=224","https://youtu.be/lOshTzDA4SA?t=541"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}